Misho, 12 Oct ~12:20 UTC: „E კი“ (§129). REGISTRATION_RESEARCH_ON = true. Fix to 0193: the run
wrote source „research“, which no reader knows; it now writes „public_research“, the Axel research's
own, so „facts about me“ lists and removes them and the republish passes leave them out. §129 recorded
in ADMIN_WRITE_OPERATIONS. Undo: the switch back to false.

